                "headline": "Heat Advisory issued September 12 at 12:13PM CDT until September 13 at 7:00PM CDT by NWS Tulsa OK",
                "description": "* WHAT...Heat index values up to 107 expected.\n\n* WHERE...Portions of east central, northeast, and southeast\nOklahoma.\n\n* WHEN...From noon to 7 PM CDT Sunday.\n\n* IMPACTS...Heat related illnesses are possible especially impacting\nthose not acclimated to the conditions or those performing\nstrenuous activities.",
